.research/260218_mutation_design_proposal.md:867:### Q5: Transaction/atomic batch support?
.research/260218_mutation_design_proposal.md:869:**Proposal**: Out of scope for v1. Independent batch execution (matching existing semantics). Handlers can implement internal transactions if needed. If demand arises, add `--atomic` flag in a future version that wraps all mutations in a handler-provided transaction callback.
